<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear list for Holy Paladin Healer in Wrath of the Lich King Classic for Phase 3. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from Heroics, reputation rewards, and the new 10-man Raid loot added to Titan Rune Dungeons.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot-gear">Holy Paladin Healer Best in Slot Gear, Gems, and Enchants - Pre-Raid Phase 3</h2>The primary thing to aim for in pre-raid is for a few big ticket items that you'll continue to use well into raiding, primarily trinkets which stay very similar for the entire expansion. While your full set will not and does not have to look like this when stepping into your first raid, this set of gear will ensure that you're more than qualified to heal even the hardest encounters in the raid, as well as making you more than powerful enough to heal most raids very handily.<br/>
<br/>You will primarily want to get the trinkets and libram, as all 3 of these will be part of your endgame raiding BiS for the rest of the game. The helm is also quite good for T9, provided you finish the 4pc with the remaining 25m pieces in Ulduar.<br/>
<br/>
