<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ticket_tarot_stack_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nobles Deck</span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<br/>
<br/>There aren't too many good BoE items in Phase 3 for Holy Paladins. Most are decent beginner options that have much stronger upgrades in both 10H and 25H ToC. However, if it saves you farming Heroic+ and they are cheap enough for you to get, they're not the worst.<br/>
<br/>As a brief note on <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44255/darkmoon-card-greatness">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tarotgreatness.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmoon Card: Greatness</span></a> - while this item is listed for completeness, it is essentially deprecated as of Phase 3 as there are now finally better trinkets available which are also reasonably easy to acquire. Only buy it if you're really not intending on farming for a <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=37111/soul-preserver">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_orb_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soul Preserver</span></a> (which you really should, as it'll continue to be BiS throughout Phase 4 and 5).<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-gems">Best Gems for Holy Paladin Healer - Pre-Raid Phase 3</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Meta Socket - <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41401/insightful-earthsiege-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_shadowspirit_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Insightful Earthsiege Diamond</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Red Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40151/luminous-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Luminous Ametrine</span></a> <b>&gt;</b> <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40047/luminous-monarch-topaz">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Luminous Monarch Topaz</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Blue Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40175/dazzling-eye-of-zul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dazzling Eye of Zul</span></a> <b>&gt;</b> <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40094/dazzling-forest-emerald">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dazzling Forest Emerald</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Yellow Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40123/brilliant-kings-amber">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_38.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant King's Amber</span></a> <b>&gt;</b> <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40012/brilliant-autumns-glow">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_26.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant Autumn's Glow</span></a></div></li></ul>You will want to use only one of each orange and green gem for the meta gem requirements, in your best possible socket bonuses; in all other cases, you will ignore socket bonuses and gem <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40123/brilliant-kings-amber">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_38.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant King's Amber</span></a> everywhere. You can also alternatively use all yellow gems and a single <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49110/nightmare-tear">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_pearl_12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nightmare Tear</span></a> at a slight stat value loss, particularly if you prefer to go full Haste.<br/>
<br/>For maximum throughput if mana is not an issue, you can consider changing some of the yellow gems to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40128/quick-kings-amber">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_38.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Quick King's Amber</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>With the advent of Phase 3 and the Trial of the Crusader, epic gems are now available. They are strict upgrades from the rare gems with no socketed limitations, unlike Stormjewels. Because they're just strict upgrades, every other aspect of gemming is the same. They are fairly unlikely to be very expensive, so it's recommended to use them over the rare gems.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-enchants">Best Enchants for Holy Paladin Healer - Pre-Raid Phase 3</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Head - <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50370/arcanum-of-blissful-mending">
